                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Action to perform when tags match the tagQuietMasks pattern. For target SL, provide an SL action using ASSERTSL, DEASSERTSL, or NEGATESL. For targets S0, S1, S2, or S3, provide a session action using INVA, INVB, or FLIPAB.",
